{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eeKriDdChs6wwJ1t9sWU2Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:11.304283+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eeKriDdChs6wwJ1t9sWU2Q","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHCdYCGhAU60KHibrPGINHiaVfoX0BJx3Pa6n8nsAKDS67KuMIDIgW9CMibvYawt5sjBs089Fibb2tdaiaGYW2vAafkt8j5ulTD46F8c/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>西安外国语大学俄语学院2027年招收推荐免试研究生（以下简称“推免生”）工作即将开始，有望获得所在本科院校推荐资格且有意申请推荐免试攻读西安外国语大学博士、硕士研究生的人员，请登录下列网址进行申请：“</span><strong><span>https://stuxisu.molstone.cn/</span></strong><span>”。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHBkibtgS6VtehLEkHgmHouyQ332wr7iaAyjL8Ccsk2dqia2uPrJ00wN01tNHr7wYuOPVXTKpEp2huJVocK8Fbo5Ar8Hr0oicKsoOjY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHBia6Il9biarDazhwhjIoADbkTkgmWXc80werrYKTL53VxF5TuibzP4USNk3Xliakl8HaG0aRUO47piaOJ66x2q836icKooiaCPszo4tM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>一、学院简介</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHARzlhP3CiaU27BU8wyeMgeWyofg2AYfg006d9m7HDrrfnKwYttwFS9ownHRm3MgW5SfxMVs8YvPjCHOUiahpq3Jtc5DNOc95icI4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHCWVIcWAvvpKPICMZEfRibjNCq7yibSBaP8d2XM2iaNtBPxFA14jBaojvRiaonb5TuBSlVD8oJHV02hrD11PZsbdtoL9NzfhZrFPc8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>俄语学院始于1952年，是新中国最早开设的4所外语院校之一——西北俄文专科学校，是西北地区最大的俄语及非通用语人才培养基地。学院自1952年开始为国家培养本科层次俄语人才，1979年开始招收俄语语言文学专业硕士研究生，2013年开始招收俄语专业翻译硕士，同年获批博士研究生招生权，2014年获批设立博士后科研流动站，形成了涵盖本硕博及博士后的完整人才培养体系。</span></p><p><span>学院师资力量雄厚，现有教职工42人。其中，俄语专业教师27人，教授7人、副教授9人，博士学历教师21人，博士生导师4人，硕士生导师17人；非通用语种教师10人、外籍教师6人，“西外学者”特聘教授1人。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHCQMdb2Mtkdm7EwKpOhgR50ibUW9w4Q8m2AhdHF2w5OL2PU1omBnMySzDubP0urRQGgNfjA1Jz6tK8LC2VpJaMeFKPrkDwe484Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHANls71IMcbGNIRFBHyE6xS4MWSS6VCr9EauaIReUXarR7HrvHuqicDsV1JHmFZHGJuwFnxdo3aL5IOFE9CA8jdcqwMDh4E7aLY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>二、申请条件</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHDonkAfss3SZk5L9N2nIIxtHdOzQlMw1ybvBxN2kic8In6FjuthbAX3SpAGCSibJ44pfRay6xPUJFUly7nqB743S5fun5Q5lsuCc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHAkW7oLXgLXyWnBNyVJtprQFuO3OqomqF8o2UgT3e1Sq2IkrhJboW94CEJm85mf8RHV1fdbCibMUibHxYKNshShUbXDFjuqXv8CM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）硕士研究生</span></p><p><span>1. 拥护中国共产党的领导，品德优良，遵纪守法，身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求；</span></p><p><span>2. 全国院校获得推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生，学习成绩优秀，研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识和创新能力；</span></p><p><span>3. 诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></p><p><span>4. 2027年入学前获得本科毕业证书及学位证书。</span></p><p><span>（二）直接攻读博士研究生</span></p><p><span>申请直接攻读博士研究生（以下简称“直博生”）的除了符合（一）中的各项要求外，其学业及科研水平须符合下列条件：</span></p><p><span>1. 对学术研究有浓厚兴趣，具有较强创新精神和科研能力。本科毕业于“双一流”建设高校或与我校同类的外语院校，或毕业于其他高校且本科阶段以第一作者身份公开发表我校认定的二类B级论文1篇，或参与厅局级及以上科研项目1项（排名前3名，含项目主持人），或主持校级科研项目1项；</span></p><p><span>2. 本科阶段就读专业与报考的博士专业相同或相近；</span></p><p><span>3. 有两名所报学科专业领域内正高级职称人员的书面推荐。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHDkkj8j7YfatbwCib7xS15m4ElNmq8seom05NSgdbFwYO7ELFrgfIqoxLGrPEprL2mg7Mz99QibGMpFQx0diarACWiagzpTHnVWksA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHCqtcAo9adPib3eVZrbnTEUHibQRhZtDckJKrCy4U50wDqoQGVtYyKZ1Qvg79q5neO4P8slYpdmAoiahUvVoxmOWQGfmTkJqicjbko/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>三、接受推免申请专业</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHAtyZRb6uqaLEN0cEtVAwGJo2ib2o8rl86yGMj2nPZ51fKQWNImPJQqNrKvibJy1RtPKxS1V3MoGDcCFmON4T1r7PyVdOian81M8M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHAQJqpMCKib9DXZFGzchlrj4N4lHTuJym1BJLgCnjsnM2SkoRu65KEKgf1wfjXN328EsBkqwgyibiaSafu11gcNxxxSCXTsOXPrdY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>根据《西安外国语大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预申请公告》（详见链接</span><strong><span>https://yzw.xisu.edu.cn/info/1093/4722.htm</span></strong><span>），我院拟接收推免生的专业如下：</span></p><p><span>（一）拟接收推免直博生的专业：</span></p><p><span>俄语语言文学（050202）</span></p><p><span>（二）拟接收推免硕士研究生专业：</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHAbY4whqyR9Kq1qeSwpzX6J3B7Xx5q3IJEQfwVrgqO1KyvfcribaSTmNH87PKeOlu1lWclIic8SmtFXwd8ib4oSbKQVyyoghS64wQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHDWKOorQmNn0OWcC2PQywJicibZ95WSbFGic5f3sMEeJ1SDQB86eSBrN0D6C77mh7zwySDccFa9vAibWJ2GUtfcbN2FN3V5UJLNujg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHDdnARdc1tYUZBfAGmLgb67LaJg2fKPNA66pewML8ia3VdQA08I4uev1LiaTEJdr8XhmkqzL6rx9GrKElZibj9eK9VfHmyuWBvgSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>四、申请方式</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHAp3BeOUjsHtZibcBaJpibUjvea8sOWksf1XTOOx0cv7PMJpERhdehdNjs7gndMPMYKApwzBxFMNk2BPJJWWMiaDbrSRBCJeCuia1o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHCTRSXNpoibcdgTnwS6EGLnAFfQzobQhEQqQVT1YjXTAYdlkVX5FibtT9POdwBMEzdvKduLNlbzjXicnuib3lbg1dTLeuFpxHvyuaQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（</span><span><span>一）申请时间</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>9月7日—9月17日</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（二）申请方式</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人登录以下网址进行申请：</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>https://stuxisu.molstone.cn/</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>注意事项：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1. 申请人完成注册后，身份证号即为登录账号；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 登录后点击推免管理—推免生申请填报信息进行相关信息填写；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 申请人需将所有证明材料汇总成一个PDF文件后进行上传。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）复试安排</span></span></p><p><span><span>1. 学院通知复试</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院对报名信息进行初审，确定复试名单，向申请人发放复试通知，请申请人及时关注</span><strong><span>俄语学院官网（https://eyxy.xisu.edu.cn/）</span></strong><span>，保证电话畅通，并及时关注预留邮箱中的通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 申请人参加复试，学院确定拟录取名单</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人复试时需提供以下材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.学生证、身份证原件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.加盖学校教务部门公章的成绩单；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.学籍认证报告一份（学信网下载打印）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.其他有关材料（如专业外语等级证书、大学英语四六级考试成绩单、获奖证书、本人代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.经本人签字确认的诚信承诺书（附件1）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.其他可反映自身能力和水平的相关材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请直博生的须按上述要求参加网上报名与复试，复试时向招生单位（研究生院）提出直博申请。经招生单位同意后，可按直博生进行复试录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>请考生将上述材料电子版按顺序整理为一个文件（PDF格式），按照“2027推免预申请+姓名+联系电话”格式命名，</span><strong><span>于9月18日前发送至邮箱eyxyyjs@xisu.edu.cn。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>（四）推免服务系统</span></span></p><p><span><span>待全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统（以下简称“推免服务系统”）开通后，被拟录取的推免生需登录“推免服务系统”进行注册，并按照拟接收的专业填报相关志愿。我校将在“推免服务系统”中发放复试及拟录取通知。未按拟接收专业填报志愿者及未在规定时间内按要求完成录取确认者，均视为自动放弃。</span></span></p><p><span><span>未进行先期申请的请在“推免服务系统”开通后进行报名。学院将根据接收指标剩余情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织复试，具体安排以学院的通知为准。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHB3mHQjc8usRITD4tvrI4T1ia1Of7CO0zAeBEMI23B7x4XzkJgu5LnWDjfxlGYF54P1dEsZibeW58zH9ocBV506vWIXkvBrbqtsI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHBXVTGCp5m30rHMTw3ibyTgKmCdxDFZ2YYg7HAgj7t24UMxZbsKs7KbUCZDUKtcFK1DHlg1rSDTH4HBXiaEpCHRUQLZEujYiby1U4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>五、学费</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHBWhr7zqnpyLy5Vic5K3hZfET2AHGhFd1MJiaBGV3vAOosM2Q419VlbuLLdccxhN0Sf7n5ia3CegzuWHzwltibiazOtKyqtLQuSxR5M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHCmxljicVgMKOsBgOn4Sy4gxXgbwicAkGq1SszJ0b9ia45HyTicx1foZpMd4CFGiaxzhf1Nyt3WgX7kPzriao6WncLmySw0Y2s1ZKeZU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>所有研究生按照国家规定缴纳学费。具体学费标准以学校当年公布的收费标准为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHAcjXIqUqA3ZWbCAzSvAAjaYkSRM3QlS1MPfEr4j5ExyOvzzQVPe8Y5kd0C7CnLw6mwTfoxRgGmJibSZ9CJHjVDRVG0FWAGKYNs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHC04WbTLEsibaR6Jtia6D4Jza2Q0eqiaibcS7yqXO23OHaC3NobfoAL6cogmLWg4nNic4rwLvEBeSsuDczI7ezFGicRHEiar89atS234U/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>六、奖助学金</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHCpNzib1Biaxibw1YXegECqzog6I648DoKNSVoM4BJoYiaeUKZ4uJvHyKxZ1olliacp6MUic9PjRxgRZtMicxEruRWnMUogWXMESJWb5g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHAueJ9L69lWC0H6k8bvn49Eafoxbuqp29VlbY0ZwxkbXjwHynqOxYeYx4iaTSMrNphIjP3WhjiatY9s24vQfrc1oyqGVvmm7ReUQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 硕士研究生国家奖学金：20000元/生·年；</span></p><p><span>2. 硕士研究生国家助学金：6000元/生·年；</span></p><p><span>3. 博士研究生国家奖学金：30000元/生·年；</span></p><p><span>4. 博士研究生国家助学金：13000元/生·年。</span></p><p><span>我校还设有学业奖学金、困难补助、三助岗位等奖助体系，为研究生顺利完成学业创造良好的学习和生活条件。奖助学金政策以当年通知为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHB7LibibLLwnkvzEnRdJcn4JfZQInmgscjN22HEYWExTNg2RtlLRcvCSJiaGeLPhgLCpHQLia9iaibxn7b7OBWWQeCzvoicxxrmblniaHs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHD937VKFh4zYzerXGTF3Uvl4bzFnwFeFypNarxuI7HjC37Jn8ia1bsTjtb7WlaZKS729lHtibkTEvIz42ia1voib7743GYJKfXxy0M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>七、其他事项</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHBHCc1DcIyxDGasaKeTd6AydeFJr5t15WcsujBr5yDYBtyNncAibXXBRSEh3mPg1SzEjGRzyNZV7mnZxK2R4zP7iaDl9BI3FiboxE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hL9GaxpJmHCUGOu9ibTC1o3RZqbKRES2bdXOCmCctkdz8YicWZ0q7jErbrtbJ9Afs5TosFWCmN5XXv6MpMykCOGBs5o9Cbz4OHd6E7yl9DgQs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）有以下情形之一的，取消录取资格：</span></p><p><